            "email": "mononcqc@ferd.ca",
            "date": "2016-10-03T10:24:52Z"
          },
          "message": "Add support for counterexamples\n\nAll failing properties of a recent run will be stored on disk for that\nrun in a single batch. By calling `rebar3 proper --retry`, they will be\nretrieved and run against the current system to see if they still work.\n\nThe execution model should otherwise remain unchanged.",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "fac970a901cda6a3619bc84e18b2312a76af1f0e",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/rebar3_proper/git/trees/fac970a901cda6a3619bc84e18b2312a76af1f0e"
